## BAB IV — AUDIT ALUR (RELASI DAN EKSEKUSI)

Setiap relasi pada diagram final diverifikasi terhadap implementasi:

| Relasi | Jenis | Label | Bukti implementasi | Penilaian |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `AnalysisController ..> AnalysisService` | Dependency | calls | `self.service = service or AnalysisService()` (`analysis_controller.py:10-11`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisController ..> APIError` | Dependency | raises | `raise APIError(...)` (`analysis_controller.py:23,46,74`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisService *-- AnalysisRepository` | Composition | persistence | `self.repository = repository or AnalysisRepository()` (`analysis_service.py:291`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisService *-- StorageService` | Composition | assets | `self.storage_service = storage_service or StorageService()` (`analysis_service.py:292`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisService *-- AnalysisJobQueue` | Composition | queue | `self.job_queue = job_queue or AnalysisJobQueue(...)` (`analysis_service.py:296-299`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisService ..> AnalysisProgressReporter` | Dependency | reports progress | Reporter dibuat di `_execute_pipeline` (`analysis_service.py`) | **Perbaikan F-02** |
| `AnalysisProgressReporter ..> AnalysisRepository` | Dependency | writes progress | `_write` → `repository.update` (`analysis_service.py:126`) | **Perbaikan F-02** |
| `AnalysisService ..> AIInferenceFunctions` | Dependency | background pipeline | `self.pipeline_runner = pipeline_runner or run_pipeline` (`analysis_service.py:293`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisRepository ..> analyses` | Dependency | CRUD | `create/get_by_id/list_by_user/update/delete` pada tabel `analyses` (`analysis_repository.py:38-196`) | Sesuai |
| `AIInferenceFunctions ..> ModelService` | Dependency | inference / Grad-CAM | `predict(...model_service)` (`segmentation.py:98`); `generate_gradcam(...model_service)` (`gradcam.py:99`) | Sesuai |
| `AIInferenceFunctions ..> PipelineResult` | Dependency | output | `run_pipeline` mengembalikan `PipelineResult` (`pipeline.py:101`) | Sesuai |
| `PipelineResult *-- GradCAMResult` | Composition | gradcam | `PipelineResult.gradcam: GradCAMResult` (`pipeline.py`) | Sesuai |
| `ModelService --> ModelConfig` | Dependency | uses | `ModelService.__init__(self, config: ModelConfig = MODEL_CONFIG)` (`model_service.py:22`) | Sesuai |
| `auth_users "1" -- "0..*" analyses` | Association (DB) | FK user_id | `analyses.user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE` (`001:17`) | Sesuai |
| `auth_users "1" -- "0..1" doctor_profiles` | Association (DB) | FK user_id UNIQUE | `doctor_profiles.user_id ... UNIQUE (user_id)` (`004:12,46`) | Sesuai |
| `AnalysisClient ..> AnalysisController` | Dependency | HTTP/REST | `createAnalysis` → `POST /api/analysis` (`analysis.ts`); `AnalysisController.create_analysis` (`analysis_controller.py:13`) | Sesuai |
| `AuthContext ..> auth_users` | Dependency | Supabase Auth | `signInWithPassword` → Supabase Auth (`auth.ts:193-222`) | Sesuai |
| `DoctorProfileService ..> doctor_profiles` | Dependency | CRUD profil | `upsert` ke `doctor_profiles` (`profile.ts:131-299`) | Sesuai |

**Alur eksekusi (3 alur utama):**
1. **Analisis baru:** HTTP POST diterima `AnalysisController` → `validate_and_decode_image` → `StorageService.upload_file` → `AnalysisRepository.create` (status `processing`) → `AnalysisJobQueue.try_enqueue` → worker menjalankan `run_pipeline` (5 fase: preprocessing, inference, postprocessing, gradcam, artifact_composition) → `AnalysisProgressReporter.on_phase/on_pass` menulis `current_step`/`progress_percent` → artefak disimpan via `StorageService` → `AnalysisRepository.update` (status `completed`).
2. **Pemantauan hasil:** Frontend polling GET → `AnalysisService.get_analysis` → `AnalysisRepository.get_by_id` → `StorageService.create_signed_url` → data disajikan.
3. **Riwayat & profil:** `AnalysisRepository.list_by_user`; profil dokter via `DoctorProfileService` ke `doctor_profiles`.

